      '<div class="pc02-rg"><b>REGISTER at <i>LDAHawaii.org</i></b>Get your Zoom link, scan the QR code,' + (sq ? ' ' : '<br>') + 'or call <span style="white-space:nowrap">' + H.phone(partner) + '</span></div>'
